# The map files MUST keep CRLF line endings. The EverQuest client will not read
# them otherwise. Marking them binary stops git normalising the bytes on commit
# or on checkout, on any platform.
"Emoda Legends Maps/*.txt" -text

# Everything else normalises as usual.
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
